    "detailed_description": "<strong>Exorcist\u202fSimulator is a co\u2011op horror game.</strong><br>Break into haunted places, grab cursed relics, and send the demon back to hell\u202f\u2014\u202for let one player become that demon and hunt the team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.poster.avif?t=1750255329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.webm?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.mp4?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as part of a team of exorcists using sacred relics, holy rituals, and magical spells to survive and exorcise the demonic threat. Or embrace the darkness and become the Devil himself, hunting down the intruders one by one. Every match is a tense, atmospheric battle of wits, will, and survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Choose Your Role:</h2><strong>Exorcists:</strong> Work together to locate cursed artifacts, solve arcane puzzles, and banish the Devil before time runs out.<br><strong>The Devil:</strong> Possess, deceive, and destroy \u2014 your goal is simple: eliminate the exorcists before they cleanse the grounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.poster.avif?t=1750255329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.webm?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.mp4?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Work together:</strong> search every room, solve quick puzzles, finish the banishing ritual.<br></li><li><strong>Become the Devil:</strong> possess objects, stalk the living, strike when they panic.<br></li><li><strong>Face fresh scares</strong>: two hand\u2011built maps, random relic spots, new tricks every match.<br></li><li><strong> 4 Unique Characters:</strong> Each with their own strengths, skills, and ways to face the supernatural.</li></ul><br><br>Are you ready to cast out evil... or drag your enemies into it?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Exorcist\u202fSimulator is a co\u2011op horror game.</strong><br>Break into haunted places, grab cursed relics, and send the demon back to hell\u202f\u2014\u202for let one player become that demon and hunt the team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.poster.avif?t=1750255329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.webm?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/8118d45a57cb449b9961e4587bc8eb2e.mp4?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as part of a team of exorcists using sacred relics, holy rituals, and magical spells to survive and exorcise the demonic threat. Or embrace the darkness and become the Devil himself, hunting down the intruders one by one. Every match is a tense, atmospheric battle of wits, will, and survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Choose Your Role:</h2><strong>Exorcists:</strong> Work together to locate cursed artifacts, solve arcane puzzles, and banish the Devil before time runs out.<br><strong>The Devil:</strong> Possess, deceive, and destroy \u2014 your goal is simple: eliminate the exorcists before they cleanse the grounds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.poster.avif?t=1750255329\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.webm?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487140/extras/98ead2292324a5e33fdca987c0ff62c7.mp4?t=1750255329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Work together:</strong> search every room, solve quick puzzles, finish the banishing ritual.<br></li><li><strong>Become the Devil:</strong> possess objects, stalk the living, strike when they panic.<br></li><li><strong>Face fresh scares</strong>: two hand\u2011built maps, random relic spots, new tricks every match.<br></li><li><strong> 4 Unique Characters:</strong> Each with their own strengths, skills, and ways to face the supernatural.</li></ul><br><br>Are you ready to cast out evil... or drag your enemies into it?",
    "short_description": "Exorcist\u202fSimulator is a 1\u20114\u202fplayer online co\u2011op horror where every play asks the same, terrible question: Will you cast out the Devil\u202f\u2014or wear his skin?",
